1.1. |\n| **Prescribed Form Requirements** | **Unique to v3.1.1** | V3.1.1 introduces \"Prescribed Form\" requirements for changes to contact info (7.2), termination (8.1), and amendments (9). |\n| **\"Website\" Definition** | **Unique to v3.1.1** | Added to Appendix A in v3.1.1 to facilitate the use of online forms. |\n| **Emergency Disclosure (6.5)** | **Unique to v3.1.1** | V3.1.1 adds a provision allowing disclosure to agencies for public health, safety, and emergency response. |\n\n#### 3. Summary of Variations\n*   **Regulatory Focus:** v2.0 is focused heavily on the **Domestic Content Power Project** requirements (specifically for Solar PV), including detailed calculation tables. v3.1.1 streamlines the contract by removing these technical grids.\n*   **Administrative Modernization:** v3.1.1 introduces the concept of **\"Prescribed Forms\"** and refers to the OPA website for the latest versions of documents, whereas v2.0 is more static in its procedural descriptions.\n*   **Safety/Disclosure:** v3.1.1 expands the \"Disclosure of Information\" section to include emergency services and public health officials."}, :duration-ms 5213, :event/tags #{[:sheet #uuid "9077987c-1f87-41e8-af6c-ee2b9b1ff3c4"] [:node #uuid "df545476-40e1-43f7-a3c9-6c21f739d9b4"] [:tick #uuid "df4bf3e3-32e9-4394-a65f-5ddbcfc013bd"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:03:02.032222-05:00", :usage {:prompt-tokens 25447, :completion-tokens 809, :total-tokens 26256}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "df545476-40e1-43f7-a3c9-6c21f739d9b4", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-completed, :sheet-id #uuid "9077987c-1f87-41e8-af6c-ee2b9b1ff3c4", :event/id #uuid "019e431f-4010-70fc-9031-bfd968cc95ff"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YgtSatvqs7zjRjP91EcwR5Un00Aw3", :mulog/timestamp 1779242582034, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YgtSatvqs7zjRjP91EcwR5Un00Aw3", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution